      "title": "Web3 套利第 15 天：长鑫炒到发行价 6 倍，交易所的「股票猜涨跌」生意",
      "author": "Paxon Qiao",
      "digest": "第十五天消化 4 件材料：宇树长鑫上线币安永续，长鑫炒到发行价 6 倍，交易所做的是「股",
      "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>MoonPub Preview</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;background:#f6f7f9;padding:24px 12px;\">\n<main style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; background:#fff; padding:28px 24px; box-shadow:0 12px 36px rgba(15,23,42,0.08);\">\n<section style=\"font-family: -apple-system, 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: #333; background: #fff; padding: 0 4px;\">\n\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Cover</title>\n<style>\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{width:900px;height:500px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'SF Pro Text',-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;background:#030712}\n.cover{width:900px;height:500px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:radial-gradient(circle at 78% 18%,rgba(34,197,94,.22),transparent 25%),linear-gradient(135deg,#020617 0%,#0b1020 48%,#111827 100%);color:#e5edf7;padding:64px 76px}\n.grid{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(148,163,184,.08) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(148,163,184,.08) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:34px 34px;opacity:.65}\n.glow{position:absolute;right:74px;top:54px;width:220px;height:220px;border:1px solid rgba(34,197,94,.28);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 60px rgba(34,197,94,.16)}\n.panel{position:relative;height:100%;border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.22);border-radius:18px;background:rgba(2,6,23,.72);box-shadow:0 22px 55px rgba(0,0,0,.35);padding:38px 44px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}\n.toolbar{position:absolute;top:20px;left:24px;display:flex;gap:8px}\n.dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#22c55e;box-shadow:0 0 16px rgba(34,197,94,.8)}\n.dot:nth-child(2){background:#38bdf8;box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(56,189,248,.7)}\n.dot:nth-child(3){background:#f59e0b;box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(245,158,11,.65)}\n.tag{display:inline-block;color:#86efac;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:4px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:24px}\n.prompt{color:#22c55e;margin-right:10px}\n.title{font-size:42px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.16;color:#f8fafc;max-width:640px;margin-bottom:18px;letter-spacing:.4px;text-shadow:0 0 24px rgba(34,197,94,.16)}\n.subtitle{font-size:16px;color:#a7b6c8;line-height:1.75;max-width:560px;margin-bottom:34px}\n.meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:13px}\n.chip{border:1px solid rgba(34,197,94,.32);border-radius:999px;padding:7px 13px;color:#bbf7d0;background:rgba(34,197,94,.08);font-family:'SF Mono',Consolas,monospace}\n.author{letter-spacing:1px}\n.scanline{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:62px;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#22c55e,transparent);opacity:.75}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"cover\" data-cover-style=\"geek-black\">\n  <div class=\"grid\"></div><div class=\"glow\"></div>\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"toolbar\"><span class=\"dot\"></span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span class=\"dot\"></span></div>\n    <div class=\"tag\"><span class=\"prompt\">$</span>TECH NOTES</div>\n    <h1 class=\"title\">Web3 套利第 15 天：长鑫炒到发行价 6 倍，交易所的「股票猜涨跌」生意</h1>\n    <p class=\"subtitle\">第十五天消化 4 件材料：宇树长鑫上线币安永续，长鑫炒到发行价 6 倍，交易所做的是「股票猜涨跌」生意；1inch Aqua 掏 1000 万枚代币补贴刷量，撸毛的终局是套利。两件事指向同一结论：肉在事件窗口。</p>\n    <div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"chip\">WEB3 · DEV</span><span class=\"author\">Paxon Qiao</span></div>\n    <div class=\"scanline\"></div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">Web3 套利第 15 天：长鑫炒到发行价 6 倍，交易所的「股票猜涨跌」生意</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 1.9em 0; padding: 18px 20px 18px 24px; background: #f8f8f8; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-left: 4px solid #2c2c2c; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(15,23,42,0.05); color: #888; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; letter-spacing: 0.08em;\">链上套利残酷共学 · 第 15 天\n2026-08-19</section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.55em; color: #555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2.05; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify;\">第十五天是消化日。早晨一口气来了四件材料，一篇 C Labs 公众号文章、一篇 1inch 相关的 X 长文、一份 161 章的打卡日书、一份增量笔记 PDF。按老规矩，记录优先，全部归档、交叉校验、写成笔记。下午顺手把 ponytail.dev 的规则分发机制拆了。这一天下来最值钱的发现，是两件事其实是同一件事。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">一、交易所的「股票猜涨跌」生意</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">先看币安上线宇树、长鑫永续这则新闻。一眼看过去像「股票代币来了」，拆开机制完全不是一回事。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">合成衍生品不等于股票代币。</strong> 股票代币是 1:1 锚定、背后有真实股票；永续合约只要一个 oracle 参考价，多空拿 USDT 对赌。没有股权、没有分红、没有投票权，上市后也换不成真股票。这是「股票猜涨跌」，不是「买股票」。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">事实时间线如下。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin:22px 0;padding:12px 14px;background:#f8f8f8;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;\">\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">日期</span>7/14</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">事件</span>Trade.xyz 借 Hyperliquid HIP-3 框架挂出 Pre-IPO 永续 CXMT（长鑫），参考价 5 美元</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">日期</span>7/16</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">事件</span>长鑫正式 IPO 申购，发行价 8.66 元人民币/股</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">日期</span>7/31</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">事件</span>MEXC 率先上线 UNITREEUSDT 永续，10 倍杠杆，比宇树 8/10 科创板申购早 10 天</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">日期</span>8/4</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">事件</span>Hyperliquid 宇树合约上线，开盘 73.33 美元</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">日期</span>8 月中</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">事件</span>币安上线长鑫 + 宇树永续（最晚上线）</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">日期</span>2026/12/6</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">事件</span>纳斯达克 23 小时交易制度上线（已获 SEC 批准），传统券商反击</p>\n</section>\n</section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">最炸的数字是。长鑫合约一度炒到发行价近 6 倍，宇树 4 倍多。为什么没人套利拉平？因为海外交易者进不去 A 股正股，跨市场套利的通道根本不存在。溢价能持续多久，取决于市场隔离有多强。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">绕监管三件套。不发行证券，就不需要证监会核准、券商开户、科创板 50 万门槛。7×24 小时（A 股一天 4 小时）、±20% 涨跌幅限制不适用、杠杆最高 50-100 倍、做空无借券限制。资金费 8 小时一结，极端时 -2%，1 万 U 多头 4 小时白拿 200U。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">二、1inch 掏 1000 万枚代币请人刷量</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">第二件事是 1inch Aqua 的 Maker / LP Incentive Program。群里有人在传「撸 10 万 U」的教程，第一眼看像空投活动，拆开机制，这其实是激励套利。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">Aqua 的机制。资产留在钱包里，靠 allowance 让同一批资产同时支撑多个做市 Position；LP 赚成交产生的 Swap Fee 加活动补贴。补贴池是基础奖励 1000 万枚 1INCH，最多加 50 万 USDC 的 DAO 激励。关键在分配规则。<strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">奖励按 Maker Position 实际承接的 processed volume 分配，不按锁仓量</strong>。成交越多，拿到的激励越多。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">两类玩家的命运差。普通撸毛党 $10,000 开仓，拿 $500 Reward，但 Inventory Loss -$800，净亏 $300；激励套利玩家按「奖励池大小、竞争程度、成交量、inventory risk」动态调仓，目标是吃补贴而不是吃方向。套利的不是币价，是协议的补贴。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">防刷条款齐全。wallet cap、taker-maker exclusion、wash-trading filter。官方自己写明了套利临界点。协议奖励大于制造成交量的成本，就存在机制套利者。1inch 知道这事，防刷条款就是为此设计的。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">三、两件事是同一件事</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">把两个案例放一起，模式立刻浮出来。<strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">套利的肉，都在事件窗口里</strong>。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">宇树/长鑫，打新事件窗口。Pre-IPO 参考价 5 美元 vs 发行价 8.66 元，天然基差；上新首日流动性稀薄、价格发现混乱，窗口按天计。</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">1inch Aqua，激励补贴窗口。1000 万枚代币补贴按 processed volume 分配，窗口按周计，竞争激烈后补贴迅速磨平。</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">之前的 OKX 闪赚（本币活动期 100%+ 年化）、Lighter 积分 2x，全是同一家族的成员。</td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">这印证了第二周的周认知。常驻价差早被磨平，肉在事件窗口和机制错位里。我们的监控清单从此多了一张「活动补贴期雷达」候选表，字段是补贴池规模、分配规则、风险条款、结束时间。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">四、日书 161 章，五个最强增量</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">同一天还消化了 08-17 打卡日书，161 章里 93 章是增量笔记 PDF 没有的，五个最强数据点。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">1</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">Hyperliquid funding 250 天回测，SOL 净年化 <strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">-1.2%</strong>，符号每月翻转几十次，高费率是事件不是常态</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">2</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">Bybit 杠杆 ETF 实证。平台可以随便改指数和资金费周期（8h→1h→8h），平台参数是风险变量</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">3</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">V2 大额订单 $50K，利润从 +9.12% 变 -0.56%，利润非线性</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">4</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">可执行利润漏斗 100K→980，约 <strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">1%</strong>，13 种 failure reason</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">5</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">LI.FI 拆账，平台费占 87%，BigInt 精度工程模板</td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">五、落地三件事</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">1</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">事件驱动候选清单扩展</strong>。A 股 IPO → CEX 永续上新（数据源，CEX 上新公告 + IPO 日历）+ 活动补贴期雷达（1inch Aqua / OKX 闪赚 / Lighter / Polymarket 补贴）</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">2</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">RWA 基差框架加「市场隔离」维度</strong>。隔离越强，基差越持久，但退出也越难（长鑫 6 倍溢价的前提）</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">3</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">资金费监控补「平台参数可改」风险字段</strong>。指数口径、结算周期都能被平台改，与 Bybit 实证合并为一条风险规则</td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">六、明天做什么</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">D16 主线是跨所资金费套利风控框架。BTW 观察 + CrossEx 实战参数，用户框架转数学验证。抗 2 倍涨幅需要保证金 ≥ (1+MMR) × 名义，接近无杠杆。另给 jito_arb_pipeline.py 加日志和时间戳，让它从「能跑」变「可观测」。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">第十五天收盘。四件材料消化完，事件驱动套利家族从两张案例扩张成一张候选表。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">关于本次共学</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin:24px 0;padding:0;background:#f8f8f8;border:1px solid #2c2c2c;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:10px 14px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:0.12em;\">📌 关于本次共学</p>\n<section style=\"padding:14px 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#1a1a1a;\">本系列来自「<strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">链上套利残酷共学</strong>」，由 Bruce Xu 发起的 <strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">21 天实践型共学</strong>（2026.08.05 至 08.26），<strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">692 位伙伴</strong>围绕机会发现、成本验证、策略构建、信号监控与执行复盘，用真实证据逼近答案，不做只听概念不落地的学习。\n\n🔗 活动详情 <a href=\"https://intensivecolearn.ing/programs/b43d2e97-ed88-4ca3-b12f-7ef672b01205\" style=\"color:#2c2c2c;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;word-break:break-all;\">https://intensivecolearn.ing/programs/b43d2e97-ed88-4ca3-b12f-7ef672b01205</a></section>\n</section>\n\n\n\n<section style=\"margin-top:3em;padding-top:2em;border-top:1px solid #e8e8e8;\">\n\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0;color:#888;font-size:15px;text-align:center;\">— · —</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.6em 0;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:15px;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;\">寻月隐君</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.6em 0;color:#888;font-size:14px;text-align:center;line-height:1.8;\">专注 Web3、Python、Go、Rust 技术分享，探索区块链、智能合约、DApp 等前沿内容。<br>\n技术的光，未来的道。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0 0.4em;color:#888;font-size:13px;text-align:left;line-height:1.8;\">本文为个人学习记录，不构成投资建议。链上套利有风险，请自行评估。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0 0.6em;color:#888;font-size:13px;text-align:center;\">长按下方二维码即可入阁。若二维码过期，请在公众号后台回复 加群 获取最新二维码。</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;margin:1.5em 0 0.8em;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/22kVflKPKay5YicoQQg5jGFc3Oicog8rG6B9RJb5qF5SlOLN0sFOwHFF9QXfU7Gdu9NRYG7AQ7qE6URbiaJEYsxAg3NIXEyB4yPr4B8cibkH9yg/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg\" style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto;max-width:80%;width:240px;height:auto;\" alt=\"群二维码\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;margin:1.5em 0 0.8em;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/22kVflKPKawZUpGSSSOs1hRrzvRqwcZaibaJPjfVHhRmw1Q2pKSv7HBTTJPIHrR99jatb3Xk4ukEcYtZlCZrfickdXuKMFOK6Kw0iaqJtdaWlA/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" alt=\"关注\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.8em 0;color:#888;font-size:13px;text-align:center;\">关注《寻月隐君》，一起在技术的星空下寻找属于自己的明月。</p>\n\n</section>\n\n\n</section>\n\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
    }
  ]
}
